  "description": [
    "A small, worn-down shack sits as far back off the path as it can go, backing right up to the iron fence separating town from graveyard.  It looks more like a storage shed than anything else, with chained and locked double doors in the front, a window on either side, and a single round window in what must be a mighty small attic.  Vines have clamored over and around it, but all simply cling there, dead and grey."
